                            <comment id="15080495" author="githubbot" created="Sun, 3 Jan 2016 18:32:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user samaitra opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/392&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/392&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-255&quot; title=&quot;Jvm8 warns that MaxPermSize is ignored&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-255&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-255&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Jvm8 warns that MaxPermSize is ignored&lt;/p&gt;

